&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3-6 years of experience &lt;/strong&gt;in a high-intensity analytical environment. Backgrounds in &lt;strong&gt;Investment Banking, high-growth companies &lt;/strong&gt;or similar are highly valued.&lt;/li&gt;
